WEBVTT

00:01.800 --> 00:08.020
Hold my hand until I fall asleep.

00:10.530 --> 00:14.450
<i>I guess I was the one 
who called the ceasefire.</i>

00:14.450 --> 00:18.990
<i>And it's not like she's ever 
this honest with herself.</i>

00:19.700 --> 00:21.000
All right, fine.

00:21.410 --> 00:22.500
Until you fall asleep.

00:28.050 --> 00:29.090
Right.

00:31.260 --> 00:32.260
I'm back.

00:35.010 --> 00:36.400
What are the two of you doing?

00:36.400 --> 00:38.540
N-N-N-Nothing!

00:38.540 --> 00:40.060
And where is the cleaner?!

00:40.060 --> 00:41.150
I bought some.

00:41.150 --> 00:42.970
But there's just one problem.

00:42.970 --> 00:44.880
Wh-What?

00:44.880 --> 00:48.820
For a little while now, my chest

00:48.820 --> 00:53.740
has been feeling strangely 
warm and bittersweet.

00:53.740 --> 00:58.810
I interpret this as 
your emotions flowing into me.

00:59.370 --> 01:02.200
So, what were the two of you doing?

01:03.150 --> 01:04.510
Lily-sama?!

01:27.410 --> 01:29.270
Utterly useless.

01:29.940 --> 01:33.010
Though she did defeat my snakes...

01:33.010 --> 01:35.430
Was she always that powerful?

01:36.060 --> 01:37.390
Now I'm curious.

01:38.690 --> 01:41.680
You, go take a look.

01:41.680 --> 01:43.740
We won't get approval.

01:43.740 --> 01:45.170
It's fine.

01:45.170 --> 01:47.410
I'll make the request.

01:47.410 --> 01:50.410
Very well, Sister.

01:56.460 --> 01:58.810
Come on, what are you waiting for?

01:58.810 --> 02:01.680
It's another beautiful day of demon hunting.

02:01.680 --> 02:03.780
This soon after your recovery?

02:04.520 --> 02:07.140
I need no rest.

02:07.140 --> 02:09.060
Why don't we have something to eat first?

02:09.060 --> 02:10.940
I shall treat you to thank you for visiting me.

02:10.940 --> 02:11.720
Really?

02:11.720 --> 02:12.650
Indeed.

02:12.650 --> 02:14.140
What should I ask for?

02:14.140 --> 02:15.630
I think I should go with boiled gyoza.

02:15.630 --> 02:17.000
Fried, then.

02:17.000 --> 02:19.870
I finally found you.

02:21.210 --> 02:25.890
You seem to be enjoying yourself, Lily.

02:30.300 --> 02:32.460
Nii-sama...

04:06.980 --> 04:10.680
<i>This hot guy is Amane-san's brother?</i>

04:10.680 --> 04:12.520
<i>Which has to mean...</i>

04:12.520 --> 04:14.010
<i>He's an angel!</i>

04:16.270 --> 04:17.320
And you?

04:19.780 --> 04:23.530
I-I'm... Er, I'm just, well...

04:25.940 --> 04:27.490
He's Akutsu-kun.

04:28.790 --> 04:30.790
My classmate.

04:31.200 --> 04:34.870
We bumped into each other in town, 
so we've been chatting for a bit.

04:36.010 --> 04:37.300
<i>I'm saved.</i>

04:37.300 --> 04:39.320
A classmate, huh?

04:39.320 --> 04:41.220
I should introduce myself, then.

04:42.040 --> 04:43.470
Pleased to meet you.

04:43.470 --> 04:44.930
I'm Zwei.

04:44.930 --> 04:47.540
It sounds like you've been 
a good friend to my sister.

04:47.540 --> 04:51.210
I hope you'll continue to be one. Thank you.

04:52.730 --> 04:54.690
R-Right.

04:58.070 --> 05:00.110
Th-Thank you, too.

05:00.110 --> 05:05.910
Now, I hate to interrupt your conversation, 
but may I borrow my sister for a while?

05:06.490 --> 05:07.540
O-Okay.

05:08.120 --> 05:09.850
It's been a while since we last met.

05:09.850 --> 05:12.330
I'd like for us to have a family moment.

05:12.820 --> 05:13.660
Sure.

05:14.820 --> 05:16.010
My apologies.

05:16.840 --> 05:18.420
Let's go, Lily.

05:19.050 --> 05:22.690
Well, bye-bye, Akutsu-kun.

05:36.620 --> 05:38.350
<i>I'm exhausted.</i>

05:38.350 --> 05:40.600
<i>I didn't know she had a brother.</i>

05:40.600 --> 05:42.820
<i>I got so tense, I let myself sound subservient.</i>

05:43.150 --> 05:45.260
<i>Good thing I didn't accidentally reveal myself.</i>

05:45.260 --> 05:48.210
<i>It'd be a serious issue 
if he found out who I am.</i>

05:52.700 --> 05:54.740
<i>I survived it, boss!</i>

05:54.740 --> 05:55.510
<i>Yup!</i>

05:57.490 --> 05:59.560
A family moment, huh?

06:00.350 --> 06:04.000
Come to think of it, Amane seemed 
a bit awkward back there.

06:05.270 --> 06:07.480
Well, bye-bye, Akutsu-kun.

06:08.010 --> 06:10.010
Wait... could she be...

06:10.380 --> 06:12.960
Sheesh, you could've told me you were coming!

06:12.960 --> 06:14.750
Wo hen jing ya!

06:14.750 --> 06:17.250
I have no idea what you're saying.

06:18.260 --> 06:22.210
<i>Maybe she got nervous because 
she's obsessed with her brother.</i>

06:23.070 --> 06:24.750
<i>Nah, no way.</i>

06:25.950 --> 06:27.870
<i>It's going to be okay, right?</i>

06:27.870 --> 06:29.280
<i>He's her brother.</i>

06:29.280 --> 06:31.130
<i>I'm sure he's a nice guy.</i>

06:32.110 --> 06:35.460
<i>Right, Amane?</i>

06:36.760 --> 06:40.170
Lily, you don't need to be so nervous.

06:40.620 --> 06:42.960
I've put up a barrier.

06:42.960 --> 06:44.920
No one will come near.

06:44.920 --> 06:47.610
Oh, but from a distance...

06:48.250 --> 06:50.280
They might be able to see...

06:53.250 --> 06:56.100
You making a fool of yourself.

06:57.210 --> 07:02.230
Yup, I like seeing you grovel.

07:02.730 --> 07:05.070
I'm surprised, though.

07:05.070 --> 07:07.610
I never would have thought you'd have a friend.

07:08.230 --> 07:10.760
Akutsu-kun, was it?

07:12.260 --> 07:14.970
H-He's just a classmate.

07:15.330 --> 07:17.700
We don't have a special relationship.

07:18.370 --> 07:19.630
Yeah?

07:19.630 --> 07:21.210
Not that I care.

07:21.550 --> 07:25.860
Th-That aside, what business brings you here—

07:29.900 --> 07:32.570
Whoa, that was close.

07:32.570 --> 07:34.760
You shouldn't have raised 
your head without permission.

07:34.760 --> 07:40.310
I came close to hurting your adorable face.

07:41.560 --> 07:45.150
I-I apologize.

07:46.110 --> 07:48.840
Actually, go on and raise your head.

07:48.840 --> 07:51.050
It's easier to talk that way.

07:51.900 --> 07:54.410
I'm here on behalf of Nee-san.

07:55.090 --> 07:57.910
I came to this side to ask you a question.

07:57.910 --> 08:02.920
How did you defeat the avatar 
that our sister blessed?

08:05.550 --> 08:06.620
Sheesh.

08:06.620 --> 08:09.130
It would have been easier to just disable it.

08:09.410 --> 08:10.920
You lousy demon!

08:15.930 --> 08:17.520
I knew it. Snakes.

08:17.520 --> 08:20.540
It's my avatar, and I'm taking it back!

08:28.440 --> 08:31.100
I'm not surprised you removed the blessing,

08:31.100 --> 08:34.390
but you couldn't have disabled 
the avatar so easily.

08:34.810 --> 08:36.370
Th-That was...

08:36.750 --> 08:40.020
I summoned it out of curiosity, 
and it attacked me,

08:40.020 --> 08:44.100
so I fought it desperately, 
disabled it, and removed the blessing.

08:44.520 --> 08:48.670
I-I wasn't unscathed, either, of course.

08:53.140 --> 08:57.300
Is that really a recent wound?

08:58.780 --> 08:59.840
Yes.

08:59.840 --> 09:01.890
Would you like to see it up close?

09:02.900 --> 09:03.890
No.

09:03.890 --> 09:05.290
It's fine for now.

09:05.640 --> 09:07.410
I see.

09:07.410 --> 09:09.500
By the way...

09:10.140 --> 09:14.130
You were sent to the human realm 
to eliminate demons, were you not?

09:14.130 --> 09:18.410
The demons you've been defeating 
seem to fall in a pattern, though.

09:18.410 --> 09:20.650
They're all beast types.

09:22.010 --> 09:27.260
There's no way there aren't any 
humanoid demons, even out here.

09:27.260 --> 09:32.990
Are you being lazy, 
or are you scheming something?

09:34.460 --> 09:38.220
Beast types aside, humanoids have minds.

09:38.220 --> 09:39.540
It's difficult.

09:39.540 --> 09:40.650
I see.

09:41.010 --> 09:43.810
I suppose that's the best you can do, then.

09:43.810 --> 09:44.770
Yes.

09:44.770 --> 09:48.040
Your sister and I have both been concerned.

09:48.490 --> 09:51.890
That you might be plotting something 
out of spite toward us.

09:51.890 --> 09:53.650
N-No...

09:53.650 --> 09:57.380
You know, you've been through a lot until now.

09:57.380 --> 09:59.520
Especially because of your sister.

09:59.520 --> 10:02.930
So I can't help but worry.

10:04.040 --> 10:07.040
Why would you suggest such a thing?

10:07.400 --> 10:12.790
You've given me work just 
like the other angels.

10:13.070 --> 10:14.470
I'm grateful.

10:16.370 --> 10:18.140
That's good to hear.

10:18.140 --> 10:19.800
Sorry to doubt you.

10:20.220 --> 10:21.430
Now, then...

10:21.700 --> 10:23.310
I've heard all I need to hear.

10:23.310 --> 10:25.740
I suppose I'll go home and report to Nee-san.

10:25.740 --> 10:28.890
Well, keep up the good work.

10:29.570 --> 10:32.270
Th-Thank you.

10:32.840 --> 10:36.030
One last question...

10:36.290 --> 10:40.010
You tried summoning your avatar 
and lost control, correct?

10:40.920 --> 10:41.820
Yes.

10:45.070 --> 10:47.870
Nee-san really loves mischief.

10:49.350 --> 10:55.580
She said it was a trap to make sure 
you'd struggle when you fought.

10:57.770 --> 10:59.220
A trap?

10:59.630 --> 11:02.880
And there was a condition 
that would activate the trap.

11:02.880 --> 11:08.100
That condition was that there be a
demon nearby when you summoned it.

11:12.400 --> 11:16.900
In other words, you were with a demon.

11:19.010 --> 11:21.660
Lily-sama, I'm coming!

11:26.710 --> 11:28.730
No more of this, Lily.

11:29.150 --> 11:31.940
Don't underestimate me.

11:32.680 --> 11:34.850
Depending on your answer...

11:34.850 --> 11:36.380
You know what'll happen.

11:36.380 --> 11:37.550
<i>I'm scared.</i>

11:38.260 --> 11:40.170
Who's the demon?

11:40.170 --> 11:41.180
<i>I'm scared.</i>

11:41.180 --> 11:44.220
What are you hiding?

11:44.220 --> 11:46.670
<i>Someone help me.</i>

11:47.220 --> 11:48.580
<i>Akutsu!</i>

11:57.130 --> 11:59.110
<i>That was close.</i>

11:59.110 --> 12:01.510
<i>I was about to charge in.</i>

12:02.890 --> 12:04.910
<i>Just what is going on?</i>

12:04.910 --> 12:06.940
<i>Isn't he her brother?</i>

12:06.940 --> 12:09.910
<i>I can't believe she'd be 
pinned down so easily, though.</i>

12:10.290 --> 12:12.530
<i>He's an even more capable 
angel than she is, then.</i>

12:17.460 --> 12:19.480
<i>I'm sorry, Amane.</i>

12:23.170 --> 12:26.600
<i>But his mercilessness, even towards a woman...</i>

12:27.160 --> 12:29.380
<i>He's a textbook angel.</i>

12:30.740 --> 12:31.610
<i>Hi.</i>

12:31.610 --> 12:33.440
<i>What's up, Akutsu?</i>

12:33.710 --> 12:36.130
<i>I'd forgotten after I'd spent 
so much time with her...</i>

12:39.870 --> 12:43.530
<i>Angels are cruel and inhumane.</i>

12:43.530 --> 12:46.010
<i>Hello? Are you listening?</i>

12:46.010 --> 12:47.200
<i>So is she.</i>

12:53.380 --> 12:54.390
<i>No...</i>

12:54.390 --> 12:56.390
<i>What am I thinking?</i>

12:56.390 --> 12:58.980
<i>It's in her nature. 
She wouldn't be any different.</i>

12:58.980 --> 13:01.260
<i>Amane's still an angel, after all.</i>

13:02.080 --> 13:03.760
<i>Yeah, just...</i>

13:03.760 --> 13:05.880
<i>Akutsu? Is something wrong?</i>

13:06.220 --> 13:08.530
Yes, I'm listening.

13:08.530 --> 13:10.760
I just discovered an angel.

13:11.450 --> 13:12.740
Yes.

13:12.740 --> 13:14.770
I'm not an idiot.

13:14.770 --> 13:16.860
I wouldn't fight alone.

13:17.780 --> 13:18.670
Yes.

13:18.670 --> 13:20.660
I'll get as far away as I can.

13:20.660 --> 13:21.570
Or...

13:21.570 --> 13:23.490
So I wish I could say!

13:28.410 --> 13:29.620
What's this?

13:30.780 --> 13:32.650
Oh, er...

13:32.650 --> 13:34.120
I regret to inform you...

13:36.110 --> 13:37.580
Akutsu?

13:37.920 --> 13:39.650
I've been found.

13:41.320 --> 13:42.290
Pardon me.

13:43.090 --> 13:45.420
Akutsu-kun, was it?

13:45.420 --> 13:47.060
We meet again.

13:47.060 --> 13:49.050
Where did you even come from?

13:49.390 --> 13:50.320
<i>Now what?</i>

13:50.320 --> 13:52.140
<i>I couldn't help but jump out.</i>

13:52.140 --> 13:53.930
<i>I need to distract him somehow.</i>

13:54.300 --> 13:56.650
You've been watching from up there, huh?

13:57.470 --> 14:00.360
You aren't one of ours, are you?

14:00.360 --> 14:03.230
If you were, you would have 
mentioned it earlier.

14:03.720 --> 14:05.400
Which has to mean...

14:05.400 --> 14:07.230
Yeah, you must be...

14:08.340 --> 14:11.660
You must be the demon.

14:16.250 --> 14:17.960
That face...

14:17.960 --> 14:19.620
I thought so.

14:21.730 --> 14:24.580
You're the demon that was there that day.

14:24.580 --> 14:27.260
Lily, you lied to me.

14:27.260 --> 14:29.680
You're going to need punishment.

14:29.680 --> 14:31.550
Nii-sama!

14:31.550 --> 14:33.630
But first...

14:35.370 --> 14:36.810
Demon hunting.

14:39.750 --> 14:41.480
<i>He's in a whole different league.</i>

14:41.770 --> 14:42.960
<i>Now what?</i>

14:42.960 --> 14:45.070
<i>How do I save Amane?</i>

14:46.540 --> 14:47.430
Amane!

14:48.140 --> 14:49.700
Why did you come here?!

14:49.700 --> 14:52.070
You've ruined everything!

14:52.990 --> 14:54.580
I couldn't bear to watch.

14:54.580 --> 14:56.550
Well, bear it, fool!

14:56.550 --> 14:58.330
It's all over now.

14:58.640 --> 15:01.240
I'll be interrogated, and you...

15:01.240 --> 15:02.400
And you...

15:02.400 --> 15:04.840
This is the one thing I wanted to avoid!

15:05.790 --> 15:09.750
I only had to tolerate this for a while!

15:10.220 --> 15:12.060
What could I do?

15:12.060 --> 15:13.960
My body moved on its own.

15:14.430 --> 15:15.560
Besides...

15:16.910 --> 15:20.360
I hate seeing you cry.

15:21.450 --> 15:22.650
You idiot!

15:25.770 --> 15:27.890
We just need to have your brother leave

15:27.890 --> 15:31.000
without my having to kill him, right?

15:31.000 --> 15:32.400
My brother?

15:32.400 --> 15:34.160
You don't stand a chance.

15:34.160 --> 15:37.120
Let alone when you can 
only use half your power...

15:37.120 --> 15:39.820
Just watch me.

15:40.580 --> 15:42.210
You're amusing.

15:42.210 --> 15:44.250
I like you.

15:44.250 --> 15:46.290
It's too bad you're a demon.

15:46.290 --> 15:50.010
Well, I suppose I'll give you a chance, then.

15:50.420 --> 15:55.640
If you can land even one hit on me, 
I'll pretend I never saw anything.

15:56.260 --> 15:58.090
Why, thank you.

15:58.090 --> 15:59.220
<i>Who does he think I am?</i>

15:59.220 --> 16:00.620
Okay.

16:00.620 --> 16:02.060
Well, let's start!

16:03.500 --> 16:04.480
Here!

16:05.480 --> 16:07.850
Got you!

16:11.440 --> 16:14.160
<i>He's nasty!</i>

16:14.160 --> 16:16.120
<i>And that saber is a nuisance!</i>

16:17.120 --> 16:19.830
You won't get anywhere with guts alone.

16:21.710 --> 16:24.040
Looks like you've got a little fight in you.

16:25.500 --> 16:29.050
What an interesting demon.

16:29.540 --> 16:31.460
Come, Quartet.

16:38.760 --> 16:40.780
Who are these people?!

16:40.780 --> 16:43.230
My adorable avatars.

16:43.230 --> 16:46.500
I guess there isn't much to you after all.

16:46.500 --> 16:48.400
You...

16:49.580 --> 16:51.690
<i>I can't move!</i>

16:51.690 --> 16:53.180
Just give up.

16:53.180 --> 16:54.530
Yup, yup.

16:54.530 --> 16:55.930
Don't bother.

16:55.930 --> 16:57.650
You're a stubborn one.

16:57.650 --> 16:58.750
You can't win.

16:58.750 --> 17:01.120
They're basically copies of me.

17:01.120 --> 17:02.250
Now...

17:02.250 --> 17:06.670
I could exorcise you right away, 
but that would be no fun.

17:06.670 --> 17:07.580
Right!

17:07.580 --> 17:08.540
Yup, yup.

17:08.540 --> 17:09.540
Correct.

17:09.540 --> 17:11.090
It would be no fun.

17:11.090 --> 17:12.220
Lily.

17:12.590 --> 17:14.180
Over here.

17:14.740 --> 17:16.760
Y-Yes.

17:17.500 --> 17:18.700
Don't go!

17:20.670 --> 17:22.870
We were in the middle of talking.

17:23.690 --> 17:25.810
Now, why don't you tell me...

17:25.810 --> 17:29.150
How did you get that demon on your side?

17:29.450 --> 17:31.230
Did you seduce him?

17:31.230 --> 17:32.330
No.

17:32.330 --> 17:34.150
I-I...

17:34.150 --> 17:36.110
Yes, I suppose you wouldn't.

17:36.500 --> 17:39.160
Not with your disgusting body.

17:39.620 --> 17:42.160
Wh-What are you talking about?

17:42.420 --> 17:44.480
You really don't know, do you?

17:44.480 --> 17:45.800
What do you say, Lily...

17:45.800 --> 17:49.290
Why don't you tell him, 
as your final offering?

17:49.710 --> 17:51.460
No...

17:51.460 --> 17:52.750
Anything but that.

17:54.540 --> 17:56.010
Please spare me.

17:58.090 --> 17:59.090
Nope.

18:07.900 --> 18:09.270
No!

18:09.270 --> 18:10.160
Huh?

18:10.160 --> 18:12.150
That's odd.

18:12.530 --> 18:14.380
What the hell are you doing?!

18:14.380 --> 18:16.060
You call yourself her brother?!

18:16.060 --> 18:17.700
Shut up.

18:17.700 --> 18:19.910
You don't know anything, do you?

18:20.240 --> 18:23.410
I'm educating you, so be quiet for a second.

18:25.750 --> 18:28.520
Oh, I see what you're doing.

18:28.520 --> 18:30.210
You're so clever, Lily.

18:30.210 --> 18:31.700
Move your hands.

18:33.470 --> 18:35.840
Otherwise, I'll take them off, too.

18:41.560 --> 18:43.410
Good girl.

18:55.060 --> 18:58.560
You were hiding it by weaving 
your chains in lightly.

18:58.560 --> 19:00.910
You really are clever.

19:01.510 --> 19:02.460
Don't look.

19:02.910 --> 19:06.230
Please, Akutsu.

19:06.660 --> 19:11.210
She has this crest wrapped 
around her entire body.

19:11.210 --> 19:12.790
Isn't that hilarious?

19:13.100 --> 19:15.080
<i>It's not funny at all.</i>

19:15.490 --> 19:18.330
<i>In fact, it's infuriating.</i>

19:18.950 --> 19:22.450
<i>I won't be satisfied until I beat the shit 
out of this damn brother of hers!</i>

19:22.970 --> 19:25.310
Why don't I ask you, too, then?

19:25.310 --> 19:28.120
Why are you hanging out with Lily?

19:28.120 --> 19:30.300
You're a demon, and she's your enemy.

19:30.300 --> 19:34.200
Not to mention, she's a wingless.

19:34.200 --> 19:35.730
A wingless?

19:38.480 --> 19:40.450
What the hell are you talking about?

19:40.450 --> 19:41.990
She has wings!

19:41.990 --> 19:44.910
Oh? You've seen them, then.

19:44.910 --> 19:46.530
You've seen Lily's wings.

19:48.740 --> 19:51.210
Lily, show him.

19:52.590 --> 19:54.430
You heard me, didn't you?

19:56.660 --> 19:58.490
Nii-sama...

19:59.890 --> 20:01.470
Show him.

20:21.130 --> 20:23.490
Well done.

20:29.400 --> 20:30.950
What's so funny?!

20:32.340 --> 20:33.560
I see.

20:34.060 --> 20:36.670
You never knew, huh?

20:37.040 --> 20:40.970
Wings are a symbol of an angel's power.

20:46.050 --> 20:46.920
Hey!

20:46.920 --> 20:47.890
You!

20:47.890 --> 20:48.770
Son of a...

20:48.770 --> 20:49.760
Let me go!

20:49.760 --> 20:51.100
I told you not to bother.

20:51.100 --> 20:51.950
Yup, yup.

20:51.950 --> 20:52.960
You're so persistent.

20:52.960 --> 20:54.310
You are.

20:54.310 --> 20:57.060
Run, Amane!

21:06.530 --> 21:09.060
In other words...

21:10.170 --> 21:12.120
She's a fraud.

21:15.720 --> 21:17.290
You!

21:17.290 --> 21:19.540
You don't learn, do you?

21:19.890 --> 21:22.660
You aren't going to escape from them.

21:22.660 --> 21:23.720
Yup, yup.

21:23.720 --> 21:24.550
Shit!

21:25.540 --> 21:28.470
Those are practically bird feathers.

21:29.140 --> 21:31.720
You took the texts way too seriously.

21:32.350 --> 21:33.510
Have a look.

21:39.390 --> 21:41.540
Totally different.

21:43.670 --> 21:45.990
<i>How far do you need to go?</i>

21:48.250 --> 21:54.900
<i>You dashed her pride, humiliated her, and...</i>

22:04.070 --> 22:05.780
<i>Tarnished her!</i>
